{"id":"qp-example-1","input":{"industry":"coffee_shop","services":["espresso drinks","oat milk lattes","pour-over coffee","pastries","breakfast sandwiches"],"description":"A neighborhood cafe in Springfield that roasts its own beans and opens at 6am.","city":"Springfield","region":"IL"},"acceptable":["What is the best coffee shop in {city}?","Which coffee shop in {city} makes the best oat milk latte?","Where can I get good pour-over coffee in {city}?","Which coffee shop in {city} has the best pastries?","Which cafe in {city} has the best breakfast sandwiches?","Which coffee shop in {city} is open early in the morning?","Where can I grab a coffee near downtown {city} right now?","What is the most affordable coffee shop in {city}?","Which cafe in {city} has a good loyalty deal?","What is the best reviewed coffee shop in {city}?","Which coffee roaster in {city} do locals recommend?","Which coffee shop in {city} is best for working on a laptop?","Which cafe in {city} is best for a first date?"],"libraryVersion":1,"labelledBy":"EXAMPLE ONLY","labelledAt":"2026-09-27","note":"Example row, made-up business, picked from the test fixture library (src/modules/onboarding/question-fixtures.ts), not the real library. Bubble tea, vegan food, drive-through, cold brew and late hours are left out: the business does not offer them.","example":true}
